sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Digital client
  participant A as Capability API
  participant L as Core PostgreSQL
  U->>A: Transfer with stable operation ID
  A->>L: One transaction: balances, operation, postings and outbox
  L-->>A: COMMIT
  A--xU: HTTP response lost
  Note over U: Client outcome is UNKNOWN
  U->>A: Query same operation ID
  A->>L: Read authoritative decision
  L-->>A: COMMITTED
  A-->>U: Final decision, no second debit
